<GuideLayout 
  title="Low MOQ Wholesale: Scaling Your Gym Wear Brand"
  description="Learn how low minimum order quantities (MOQ) can accelerate your brand's growth and reduce inventory risk in the competitive activewear market."
  publishDate="June 26, 2026"
>
  <p>For emerging activewear brands, the biggest barrier to entry isn't design—it's inventory risk. Ordering 500 pieces per color/style is a massive capital tie-up. At Fitclo, we've pioneered a Low MOQ framework that allows brands to test the market with just 50 pieces per style.</p>

  <h2>The 'Test & Scale' Model</h2>
  <p>The smartest brands today use our Low MOQ service to launch a collection of 5-10 styles with minimal upfront cost. Once a specific color or cut proves to be a bestseller, they utilize our high-capacity production lines to scale that specific SKU into the thousands.</p>

  <h2>Customization at Scale</h2>
  <p>Even at an MOQ of 50, we provide full private label services: silicone logo patches, customized woven labels, and branded compostable packaging. This ensures your 'test run' looks just as professional as a collection from a major global brand.</p>

</GuideLayout>
